async function loadDownloadSearchHistory(){const target=$('#downloadSearchHistory');if(!target)return;try{const rows=await api('/jobs/download-search-history?limit='+(Number(downloadSearchHistoryLimit.value)||25));target.innerHTML=rows.length?`<div class="downloadRunTable"><div class="downloadRunHead"><span>Schedule</span><span>Finished</span><span>Checked</span><span>Found</span><span>Downloaded</span><span>Skipped</span><span>Failed</span><span>Result</span></div>${rows.map(x=>`<article class="downloadRunRow"><b>${x.schedule==='older'?'Older releases':'Recent releases'}</b><span>${new Date(x.finished_at).toLocaleString()}</span><span>${x.checked||0}</span><span>${x.found||0}</span><span class="runDownloaded">${x.downloaded||0}</span><span>${x.skipped||0}</span><span class="${x.failed?'runFailed':''}">${x.failed||0}</span><small title="${attr(x.error||'')}">${x.error?esc(x.error):'Completed'}</small></article>`).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="empty">No monitored-search runs have completed yet.</div>'}catch(e){target.innerHTML=`<div class="empty">${esc(e.message)}</div>`}}
